#### 1. Personal, Academic & Rosetta Decoding Use (Free of Charge)
You are granted a free, non-exclusive license to inspect, execute, evaluate, research, and decode telepathic transmissions (including CLI usage via `toai-telepath inspect` or educational exploration).

#### 2. Commercial Production Deployment (Patron License Required)
